  "body_text": "--- 先说福利吧 ---\n福利一： 买过豆子的客人，去展会现场都可以领一组最近新到的哥伦比亚，其中包含\n哥伦比亚Tabi蜜处理\n哥伦比亚Gesha日晒\n哥伦比亚Castillo厌氧\n哥伦比亚Caturra日晒\n福利二：6.30 - 7.7 微店全场满减活动，50起就可以有小福利哦，\n并且会随机送小Hustle，下单务必注意满减是否生效\n如果有问题，不要急着付款，先和小客服确认\n----------- OK 北京展会内容 -----------\n北京展会上，我们依旧是和\n甜蜜小伙伴“甜牙齿”\n一起站台\n大家可以来现场吃糖喝咖啡\n不买光吃 可以\n不吃光买 可以\n不吃不买 打个招呼 撩几句 也可以\n我们的展位在\n5F21\n别忘记去提前注册免费门票哦\n我们带过去的豆子/挂耳包有\nEthiopia Gesha Village Surma Gesha Washed\nBurundi Kayanza Rubagabaga Bourbon Washed\nBurundi Kayanza Muruta Bourbon Natural\nKenya Nyeri Maganjo PB SL28/SL34 Washed\nGuatemala Actenago El Muro Gesha Honey\nCosta Rica Cpey Tobosi Gesha Honey\nPanama Volcan Hartmann Gesha Natural\nEcuador Loja Clara Sidra Natural\nEcuador Intag Soledad Caturra/Castillo Honey\nColombia Huila Claudia Caturra Natural\nColombia Huila Villa Gabriela Tabi Honey\nColombia Huila El Roble Gesha Natural\nColombia Antioquia Los Pinos Castillo Anearobic Dry-fruit\nPapua New Guinea Eastern Highlands Boka Arusha/Bourbon Washed\nChina Yunnan Baoshan Zuo Farm Typica Honey\n注意扫描下方二维码解锁福利",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          --- 先说福利吧 ---\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          福利一： 买过豆子的客人，去展会现场都可以领一组最近新到的哥伦比亚，其中包含\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            哥伦比亚Tabi蜜处理\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            哥伦比亚Gesha日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            哥伦比亚Castillo厌氧\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            哥伦比亚Caturra日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          福利二：6.30 - 7.7 微店全场满减活动，50起就可以有小福利哦，\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          并且会随机送小Hustle，下单务必注意满减是否生效\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          如果有问题，不要急着付款，先和小客服确认\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4nicCia1VibByiaCqehKJ0OAwBfcchvp3Fktwychtib2GubOicFABqLU4CILICM0SYs5jvSZJsYZKZE0XfdQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;width: 391px;height: 374px;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ----------- OK 北京展会内容 -----------\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4nicCia1VibByiaCqehKJ0OAwBfcCic92GeUnicibOyVabJsiakTyFRrOkpia8fevZ0D4wPtqicaPRdAaSovkY3w/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          北京展会上，我们依旧是和\n         </span>\n<strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          甜蜜小伙伴“甜牙齿”\n         </strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          一起站台\n         </span>\n<br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          大家可以来现场吃糖喝咖啡\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          不买光吃 可以\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          不吃光买 可以\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          不吃不买 打个招呼 撩几句 也可以\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我们的展位在\n         </span>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 251, 0);\">\n           5F21\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4nicCia1VibByiaCqehKJ0OAwBfcEc0Y3NaIicGvRRD6GbcuIUDdpHjS0cutic3lKHpAsO52P56zZoLEyuwA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          别忘记去提前注册免费门票哦\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4nicCia1VibByiaCqehKJ0OAwBfcAEiaz3mZEuU8sh7I4kSc2gaWvAibVxxpfwia59Ty6tfJKa6H8642d2V5g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\"/>\n</span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我们带过去的豆子/挂耳包有\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Ethiopia Gesha Village Surma Gesha Washed\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Burundi Kayanza Rubagabaga Bourbon Washed\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Burundi Kayanza Muruta Bourbon Natural\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Kenya Nyeri Maganjo PB SL28/SL34 Washed\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Guatemala Actenago El Muro Gesha Honey\n            <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Costa Rica Cpey Tobosi Gesha Honey\n            <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Panama Volcan Hartmann Gesha Natural\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Ecuador Loja Clara Sidra Natural\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Ecuador Intag Soledad Caturra/Castillo Honey\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Colombia Huila Claudia Caturra Natural\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Colombia Huila Villa Gabriela Tabi Honey\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Colombia Huila El Roble Gesha Natural\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Colombia Antioquia Los Pinos Castillo Anearobic Dry-fruit\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Papua New Guinea Eastern Highlands Boka Arusha/Bourbon Washed\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            China Yunnan Baoshan Zuo Farm Typica Honey\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          注意扫描下方二维码解锁福利\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n8Y9vYibh11kLP9LaJ3XvF2pkFCWzVzI6xDXrl8yfFrSGkGibj50Kf8OdW1phgBq9smic9TQxpbFicicsQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
